f?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010EXTRA STAGE\u3011</strong></h2>This is an extra stage with increased difficulty!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/75baa096f606e427214595ae089f8aa6.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span>",
